          "content": "{\"content\":\"{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"github\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"7291\\\",\\\"externalId\\\":\\\"5822828114\\\",\\\"revision\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T03:25:17Z\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"issue\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"perf: git config source spawns one git cat-file process per tracked blob\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"## What is wrong\\\\nEach tracked blob is read by exec'ing `git cat-file blob`.\\\\n\\\\nLocation: internal/instance/gitsource.go:extractRevision (l.418, exec at l.468) and writeBlob (l.512, exec at l.524).\\\\n\\\\n## Evidence\\\\nPer-entry exec confirmed by reading the code; not measured.\\\\n\\\\n## Proposed scope\\\\nMeasure first, then use a single long-lived `git cat-file --batch` process (or equivalent) per extraction.\\\\n\\\\n## Acceptance\\\\n- [ ] One process per revision extraction instead of per blob\\\\n- [ ] Output files byte-identical; benchmark before/after in PR\\\\n\\\\nConfidence: moderate (lens: performance)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n_Evidence source: quality-sprint collated findings (this run)._\\\\n\\\\nNomination key: qs/performance/internal/instance/gitsource.go#extractRevision\\\\n\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"area:runner\\\",\\\"goobers:approved\\\",\\\"goobers:ready\\\",\\\"goobers:claimed\\\",\\\"goobers:nominated\\\",\\\"type:chore\\\",\\\"goobers:cloud\\\"],\\\"state\\\":\\\"open\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"open\\\",\\\"links\\\":[{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"self\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7291\\\"}],\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7291\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T01:17:22Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T03:25:17Z\\\",\\\"readyAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T01:40:53Z\\\",\\\"fields\\\":{\\\"comments\\\":4,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T01:17:22Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":5822828114,\\\"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by\\\":0,\\\"locked\\\":false,\\\"number\\\":7291,\\\"state\\\":\\\"open\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"perf: git config source spawns one git cat-file process per tracked blob\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-13T03:25:17Z\\\",\\\"user.login\\\":\\\"goobersbot[bot]\\\"},\\\"raw\\\":{\\\"id\\\":5822828114,\\\"number\\\":7291,\\\"title\\\":\\\"perf: git config source spawns one git cat-file process per tracked blob\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"## What is wrong\\\\nEach tracked blob is read by exec'ing `git cat-file blob`.\\\\n\\\\nLocation: internal/instance/gitsource.go:extractRevision (l.418, exec at l.468) and writeBlob (l.512, exec at l.524).\\\\n\\\\n## Evidence\\\\nPer-entry exec confirmed by reading the code; not measured.\\\\n\\\\n## Proposed scope\\\\nMeasure first, then use a single long-lived `git cat-file --batch` process (or equivalent) per extraction.\\\\n\\\\n## Acceptance\\\\n- [ ] One process per revision extraction instead of per blob\\\\n- [ ] Output files byte-identical; benchmark before/after in PR\\\\n\\\\nConfidence: moderate (lens: performance)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n_Evidence source: quality-sprint collated findings (this run)._\\\\n\\\\nNomination key: qs/performance/internal/instance/gitsource.go#extractRevision\\\\n\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"open\\\",\\\"state_reason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"locked\\\":false,\\\"comments\\\":4,\\\"html_url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7291\\\",\\\"user\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"goobersbot[bot]\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Bot\\\"},\\\"labels\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"area:runner\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"1d76db\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Local runner: lifecycle, scheduler, stages, CLI\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"goobers:approved\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"0E8A16\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"goobers:ready\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"1D76DB\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"goobers:claimed\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"FBCA04\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Currently claimed by an in-flight run\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"goobers:nominated\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"5319E7